ce-alerts-magic-energy-name = Magical energy
ce-alerts-magic-energy-desc = Your reserve of internal magical power, allowing you to cast spells.

ce-alerts-health-name = Health
ce-alerts-health-desc = Your vitality reserve. The lower it is, the worse. Please try to survive.

ce-alerts-confused-aura-name = Confused aura
ce-alerts-confused-aura-desc = Your magical aura has been altered, and you leave false traces when using magic spells.

ce-alerts-aircaught-name = Air caught
ce-alerts-aircaught-desc = You are caught in an air current that prevents you from falling lower or rising higher.

# Hunger

ce-alerts-fed-name = Sated
ce-alerts-fed-desc = You ate well, feel full, and your health passively regenerates.

ce-alerts-well-fed-name = Stuffed
ce-alerts-well-fed-desc = You overate a bit! Your health passively regenerates, even stronger than usual, but moving is harder due to your full stomach.

ce-alerts-overfed-name = Overstuffed
ce-alerts-overfed-desc = You ate WAY too much! No, really, this is too much. You are experiencing physical pain from your overfull stomach, and moving is difficult.

ce-alerts-deadfed-name = Death by gluttony
ce-alerts-deadfed-desc = Gluttony is a deadly sin. And you have broken it.

ce-alerts-good-food-aftertaste-name = Pleasant aftertaste
ce-alerts-good-food-aftertaste-desc = Well-prepared food gives you an additional bonus to health regeneration.

ce-alerts-bad-food-aftertaste-name = Awful aftertaste
ce-alerts-bad-food-aftertaste-desc = Terribly prepared food makes you feel nauseous.

# Thirst

ce-alerts-hydrated-name = Hydrated
ce-alerts-hydrated-desc = You are hydrated and feel great. Your stamina capacity is increased.

ce-alerts-well-hydrated-name = Overhydrated
ce-alerts-well-hydrated-desc = You drank a lot! Your stamina capacity is greatly increased, but moving is harder due to excess fluid.

ce-alerts-overhydrated-name = Waterlogged
ce-alerts-overhydrated-desc = You drank WAY too much! Your body struggles with the excess fluid, and your movements are seriously impaired.

ce-alerts-deadhydrated-name = Death by hydration
ce-alerts-deadhydrated-desc = Hyponatremia is no joke. Your body could not withstand the water overload.
